# Release — {{APP_NAME}}

> Source of truth for **publishing endpoints** and the **release runbook**. Concrete IDs/keys live in 1Password and CI secrets — never plaintext here.

## Publishing endpoints

### iOS — App Store Connect
- **Apple Team ID:** _stored in 1Password — `vault://AGL/{{REPO}}/AppleTeamID`_
- **Bundle ID:** `{{IOS_BUNDLE_ID}}`
- **App Store Connect API Key:** `vault://AGL/{{REPO}}/ASC-API-Key`
- **TestFlight Group:** `{{TESTFLIGHT_GROUP}}`
- **fastlane lane:** `bundle exec fastlane ios beta` (TestFlight) / `release` (App Store)
- **Provisioning:** `fastlane match` repo `{{MATCH_REPO}}`

### Android — Google Play Console
- **Package name:** `{{ANDROID_PACKAGE}}`
- **Service-account key:** `vault://AGL/{{REPO}}/GooglePlay-SA-Key`
- **Track:** internal → closed → open → production
- **fastlane lane:** `bundle exec fastlane android beta` / `release`
- **Signing:** Play App Signing enabled; upload key in `vault://AGL/{{REPO}}/UploadKey`

### Web — hosted client
- **Domain:** `{{WEB_DOMAIN}}`
- **Provider:** {{WEB_PROVIDER}} (Vercel / Netlify / Cloudflare Pages / S3+CF)
- **Deploy command:** `{{WEB_DEPLOY_CMD}}`
- **CDN purge:** `{{CDN_PURGE_CMD}}`

### Backend service
- **Image registry:** `{{REGISTRY}}/{{IMAGE_NAME}}`
- **Deploy target:** {{DEPLOY_TARGET}} (Fly.io / Render / k8s / Cloud Run / etc.)
- **Health check:** `{{HEALTH_URL}}`
- **Migrations:** `{{MIGRATION_CMD}}`

### npm/pnpm package (if published)
- **Registry:** https://registry.npmjs.org
- **Package:** `{{NPM_PACKAGE}}`
- **Access:** {{NPM_ACCESS}} (public / restricted)
- **2FA:** required on publish
- **Publish lane:** `pnpm publish --access public`

### Browser extension (if applicable)
- **Chrome Web Store:** `{{CHROME_EXT_ID}}`
- **Firefox Add-ons:** `{{FIREFOX_EXT_ID}}`
- **Edge Add-ons:** `{{EDGE_EXT_ID}}`

### Crashlytics / Sentry / observability
- **Project:** `{{OBSERVABILITY_PROJECT}}`
- **dSYM upload:** automated via fastlane `upload_symbols_to_crashlytics`

### GitHub Releases
- **Tag format:** `vX.Y.Z` (semver)
- **Release notes:** auto-generated from `CHANGELOG.md`

## Version bump (per release)

### React Native / Expo
- [ ] `package.json` → `version`
- [ ] `app.json` or `app.config.ts` → `version`, `ios.buildNumber`, `android.versionCode`

### Flutter
- [ ] `pubspec.yaml` → `version: 1.2.3+45` (semver+build)

### Native iOS
- [ ] `Info.plist` (or `xcconfig`) → `CFBundleShortVersionString`, `CFBundleVersion`

### Native Android
- [ ] `app/build.gradle(.kts)` → `versionName`, `versionCode`

### Node / web
- [ ] `package.json` → `version`

## Release runbook

### 1. Pre-flight (on `main`)
- [ ] CI green
- [ ] Coverage gate passing (≥90% line / ≥85% branch)
- [ ] CHANGELOG.md updated
- [ ] Version bumped (above)
- [ ] Tag pushed: `git tag vX.Y.Z && git push origin vX.Y.Z`

### 2. iOS publish
```bash
bundle exec fastlane ios beta      # uploads to TestFlight
# smoke test in TestFlight
bundle exec fastlane ios release   # promotes to App Store review
```

### 3. Android publish
```bash
bundle exec fastlane android beta      # internal track
# promote in Play Console: internal → closed → open → production
```

### 4. Web / server publish
```bash
{{WEB_DEPLOY_CMD}}
{{SERVER_DEPLOY_CMD}}
```

### 5. Post-release
- [ ] dSYM/mapping uploaded to crash reporter
- [ ] Smoke test in production for 30 minutes
- [ ] GitHub Release created with notes
- [ ] Announce in `#{{SLACK_CHANNEL}}`

## Rollback

| Channel | Action |
| --- | --- |
| **iOS** | App Store: Phased Release pause; TestFlight: expire build. Cannot un-publish; ship hotfix `vX.Y.Z+1`. |
| **Android** | Play Console → halt rollout (immediate). Roll back to previous version via "Rollout > Halt > Resume previous". |
| **Web** | `{{WEB_PROVIDER}}` → revert to previous deployment (one-click). |
| **Server** | Re-deploy previous image tag; run down-migration if schema changed. |
| **npm** | `npm dist-tag rm` + `pnpm publish` of patched version (cannot unpublish after 72h). |

